Keep a shared nums as an empty list of whole numbers.
Place 1 into nums.
Place 2 into nums.
Place 4 into nums.
Place 8 into nums.
Sort nums.
Keep a shared memo as an empty list of whole numbers.
For every spot from 0 to 3.
Place 0 into memo.

To chain from index (a whole number).
If index is 0, set item 0 of memo to 1, return.
If item index of memo is more than 0, return.
The best is 1.
For every prior from 0 to index minus 1.
The rest is item index of nums modulo item prior of nums.
If rest is 0.
Chain from prior.
The candidate is item prior of memo plus 1.
If candidate is more than best, set best to candidate.
Set item index of memo to best.

The bestend is 0.
The bestlen is 0.
For every spot from 0 to 3.
Chain from spot.
If item spot of memo is more than bestlen, set bestlen to item spot of memo, set bestend to spot.

Keep a shared prior as 0.
To seek from spot (a whole number) with target (a whole number).
If spot is less than 0, set prior to -1, return.
The rest is item target of nums modulo item spot of nums.
If rest is 0 and item spot of memo plus 1 is item target of memo, set prior to spot, return.
Seek from spot minus 1 with target.

The current is bestend.
The reversed is an empty list of whole numbers.
Repeat while current is at least 0.
Place item current of nums into reversed.
Seek from current minus 1 with current.
Set current to prior.

The parts is an empty list of text.
The lastrev is the last position of reversed.
For every spot from 0 to lastrev.
The source is lastrev minus spot.
The piece is format whole number item source of reversed as text.
Place piece into parts.

The line is join parts with ",".
Show line.
